    <string name="help_faq">Questions farmers ask</string>
    <string name="faq_offline_q">Does Inama work without internet?</string>
    <string name="faq_offline_a">Yes. Photo checks, questions, lessons and tasks work offline using the reviewed guide on your phone. With internet, answers can use the Inama server’s AI and live weather.</string>
    <string name="faq_sure_q">How sure is Inama?</string>
    <string name="faq_sure_a">Every answer shows High, Medium or Low confidence and why. When Inama is not sure, it gives only safe steps and suggests asking a person.</string>
    <string name="faq_photo_q">How do I take a good photo?</string>
    <string name="faq_photo_a">Pick one sick leaf, stand in the shade, hold the phone steady, and fill the frame with the sick part.</string>
    <string name="faq_data_q">Who sees my data?</string>
    <string name="faq_data_a">Only you, unless you allow your farmer promoter to see your fields. You can change this in Settings › Privacy.</string>
    <string name="faq_language_q">When will Inama speak Kinyarwanda?</string>
    <string name="faq_language_a">Kinyarwanda is planned for the next version. The app is already built so the language can be switched on without changing how it works.</string>
    <string name="faq_person_q">Can a person check my plant?</string>
    <string name="faq_person_a">Yes. On any result, tap “Ask a farmer promoter to check” and they will reply in the app.</string>
    <string name="help_about">Inama MVP. Advice content is a draft and must be reviewed by agronomists before field use.</string>
